 <h3><u>Behen husain ki hu\'n</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Haaye...<br> jab aai shaam ki basti me (nange sar zainab)..(2)<br> aseer o muztar o betaabo (nauhagar zainab)..(2)<br> mu'n apna baalo'n se dhaanpe thi u'nth par zainab<br> ye roke kehti thi har dam ba chashme tarr zainab<br> haaye...</p> 
  <p>behen husain ki hu'n fatima ki jaayi hu<br> mai karbala e mualla se lutke aayi hu</p> 
  <p>1. Ujaad maariya me kho gaya chaman mera<br> bichhad gaya ali akbar sa gulbadan mera<br> hua shaheed har ek sher sa shikan mera<br> lahu rulata hai khud mujhko ye sukhan mera<br> haan...</p> 
  <p>2. Sakina bibi ne tab haath jod kar ye kaha<br> sina se dekho to ye zulm ye sitam baba<br> phuphi ke nauhe se dil hota hai taho baala<br> ke shaam walo ne mujhko nhi hai pehchana<br> haan...</p> 
  <p>3. Na koi raah me aaram hai na soti hu<br> tadapti rehti hu behaal ghum se hoti hu<br> ghame faraaq me mu'n aansuo'n se dhoti hu<br> ye bayn karti hu aur subh o shaam roti hu<br> haan...</p> 
  <p>4. Nahaar oonto ki thaame hai abid e muztar<br> kahi'n se aag barasti hai aur kahi'n patthar<br> aseere tauq salasil hai kya kare yaawar<br> wo mar na jaaye kahin mera marsiya sunkar<br> haan...</p> 
  <p>5. Ye baat shaam ke logo ko kya khabar na hui<br> ke ye jo oonto'n pe aaye hai sar khule qaidi<br> falak nasheen hai in qaidiyon me har bibi<br> khudara shaam ke logo ko ye bataye koi<br> haan...</p> 
  <p>6. Suna hai hoga ta'arruf abhi yaha'n mera<br> zamee'n chupa le mujhe ya utha le mujhko khuda<br> na sun sakungi shaqi ki zabaa'n se naam apna<br> sunu bhi kaise gawara lahu nahi karta<br> haan...</p> 
  <p>7. Zamee'n dabeer ki tazmeen hai ye mazhar ki<br> fughaa'n labo pe hai irfan ghum ke manzar ki<br> azaan e ranjo alam hai ye qalbe muztar ki<br> sadaa rulaegi ta hashr binte haider ki<br> haan...</p> 
